		(property "Description" "noknok pogo flashing interface for CH32V003 I2C modules (single-wire SWD). 3 pads: 1=GND, 2=SWIO, 3=VCC. NOTE: the footprint INCLUDES an M2.5 mounting hole that fixes the hole-to-pad spacing and acts as the pogo-clamp orientation key. Bottom-side pads (flip footprint to B.Cu). Place the hole >=3mm from the board edge."
